	optdepends = noto-fonts-cjk: Chinese, Japanese and Korean window titles
	optdepends = ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols: Nerd Font glyphs in workspace names
	optdepends = sway: the compositor dbar reads workspaces and window titles from
